# Exit Codes

- 0    OK               Command Passed
- 1    FAILURE          Command Failed
- 2    USAGE            Wrong use
- 3    ENVIRONMENT      Environment issue
- 4    CONFIG           Invalid config
- 5    IO               Read/write issue
- 6    INTERNAL         xLaDe bug or misc
- 7    UNKNOWN          Unrecognised
- 8	   PERMISSION	    Insufficient permissions
- 9	   DEPENDENCY	    Dependency issue is missing or unavailable
- 10   TIMEOUT	        Time limit exceeded
- 11   NETWORK	        Network failure
- 12   CANCELLED	    Operation cancelled by tool or user
- 126  NOT_EXECUTABLE	Command found but can't be executed
- 127  NOT_FOUND	    Not Found
- 130  INTERRUPTED      Ctrl+C

